_5688x3792.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Izv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbff7ac00-95dc-421b-afb3-e233ac68dfa7_5688x3792.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><span>I’m excited to share that every main-stage talk from the recent Lenny &amp; Friends Summit is now online. Here’s the full list (in no particular order):</span></p><ol><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GLvFTMtw4Jk\"><span>Raise the ceiling: how to scale intent, quality, and artistry with AI</span></a></strong><span> </span><em><span>(</span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/katie-dill-79168b3/\"><span>Katie Dill</span></a><span>, Head of Design at Stripe)</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DqF08Dz3nok\">How to build products on a moving frontier</a></strong> <em>(<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/danshipper/\">Dan Shipper</a>, CEO of Every)</em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VM5kuvWgwDY\"><span>The last roadmap</span></a></strong><span> </span><em><span>(</span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/clairevo/\"><span>Claire Vo</span></a><span>, How I AI)</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZG8Mf3P9xzI\">The limiting factor: how to design an AI software factory for speed</a></strong> <em>(<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/geoffrey-charles/\">Geoff Charles</a>, CPO at Ramp)</em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/BtK4kFI1LNo\">Roles aren’t converging—they’re expanding</a></strong> <em>(<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tamar-yehoshua-886217/\">Tamar Yehoshua</a>, Chief Product and AI Officer at Atlassian)</em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/sTgM_sbLMNg\"><span>The new playbook: what it takes to be a top PM today</span></a></strong><span> </span><em><span>(</span><a href=\"http://linkedin.com/in/robbystein\"><span>Robby Stein</span></a><span>, VP Product, Google Search)</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/fn8wnmpVqeI\">The high-impact IC era</a></strong> <em>(<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/elenaverna/\">Elena Verna</a>, Head of Growth at Lovable)</em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fF3lkTCM5-c\"><span>Strong opinions, loosely held</span></a></strong><span> </span><em><span>(</span><a href=\"http://linkedin.com/in/cagan\"><span>Marty Cagan</span></a><span>, SVPG)</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Zn9NZ-r1-C4\"><span>Context is now the product: what product leadership looks like when software can build itself</span></a></strong><span> </span><em><span>(</span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/karrisaarinen/\"><span>Karri Saarinen</span></a><span>, CEO of Linear)</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/sEXdyK6woKU\"><span>Anthropic panel</span></a></strong><span> with </span><em><a href=\"http://linkedin.com/in/amvora\"><span>Ami Vora</span></a><span>, CPO, and </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mikekrieger/\"><span>Mike Krieger</span></a><span>, Head of Labs</span></em></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://youtu.be/-ciSTkEVy30\"><span>OpenAI panel</span></a></strong><span> with </span><em><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tarstarr/\"><span>Tara Seshan</span></a>, ChatGPT Work, and <a href=\"http://linkedin.com/in/thenanyu\"><span>Nan Yu</span></a>, Codex</em></p></li></ol><p>For easy viewing, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLKmWCG9l0qPs\">here’s the entire main-stage talks playlist</a>.</p>",
